{"Unawaited async calls to deleteScheduledEmailReminder() and deleteScheduledSMSReminder() inside forEach loops cause fire-and-forget race conditions, allowing deletion operations to run untracked and try-catch to miss async errors": 0.8979873657226562, "Workflow tables dropped in subsequent migration (20260319000000_drop_workflow_tables) conflicts with this PR which adds a cancelled field to WorkflowReminder and implements cron-based cancellation logic": 0.1356378197669983, "Prisma delete operations pushed to workflowRemindersToDelete array return Promise-like Prisma objects, not plain Promises, which may not properly handle all error cases with Promise.all, and partial failures are silently logged without retry": 0.2313431203365326, "When referenceId is null and immediateDelete is not true, deleteScheduledEmailReminder marks reminder as cancelled in database but doesn't cancel anything in SendGrid, leaving potentially stale scheduled emails": 0.16834762692451477, "Migration adds cancelled column as nullable BOOLEAN without default value, creating ambiguity where existing reminders have NULL and new logic only matches cancelled: true but not NULL": 0.37372827529907227}